From 87259bee80b40439bb4e73424fc3b18f7f1b8376 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "copilot-swe-agent[bot]" <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 00:03:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add Firestore cloud backup & restore (Founder
 Aquarist only)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add CloudBackupService to save/load full backup payloads under
  users/{uid}/backups/aquarium_backup in Firestore
- Add TankNotifier.buildBackupPayload() and applyBackupPayload() to
  expose the backup/restore logic without file I/O
- Add BackupRestoreUtils.exportDataOnline() and importDataOnline()
  with Founder gate, sign-in check, and confirmation dialogs
- Add Cloud Backup and Cloud Restore ListTile widgets in settings
  (Settings → Backup / Restore), with Founder lock overlay for
  non-founders; last cloud backup stat shown in statistics section
- Add founderPerkCloudBackup perk card to FounderPerksScreen
- Add founderPerkCloudBackup perk row to RemoveAdsDialog
- Add all 21 new localization keys to app_en.arb with @metadata
- Add translated keys to app_de.arb, app_es.arb, app_fr.arb
- Update USER_GUIDE in EN/DE/ES/FR: expand Backup & Restore section
  with Local and Cloud sub-sections; update Settings table row

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Co-authored-by: TheRealFalseReality <106857076+TheRealFalseReality@users.noreply.github.com>
